Record Summary: 

“Thongor Fights the Pirates of Tarakus Thread”
Core Exhibit (Gallery Real‑Time Projection)
In the maritime continent of Lemuria, the pirate‑king Kashtar allies with a renegade wizard to wield the forbidden Gray Death, a madness‑inducing ray. He captures Thongor’s friend Karm Karvus and seizes Patanga’s finest ship.

Thongor infiltrates Tarakus disguised as a pirate crewman, reunites with Karm and an imprisoned princess, and ultimately seizes the Gray Death ship. In the climactic battle, Thongor turns the weapon against the pirate fleet, destroying Tarakus’ power and annexing it into his empire.

